// The lane the "title" shape module draws on — one shape per layer, so each can be hidden on its
// own and take its own run of effects. No rect: a shape carries its own geometry, so this layer
// covers the whole viewport.
//
// The events name no clip, and that is what they are for here: each is an ACTIVATION, saying WHEN
// the shape is on screen. A lane stating none draws its shapes throughout.
events([start(4).length(4)])
